## 3. 全域 CSS：`/home/admin/frontend/src/style.css` 與 `main.css`

- **`/home/admin/frontend/src/style.css`**：不存在。  
- **`/home/admin/frontend/src/assets/main.css`**：不存在。  
- 實際全域樣式為 **`/home/admin/frontend/src/styles.css`**，由 `main.js` 引入：

```1:5:/home/admin/frontend/src/main.js
import { createApp } from 'vue';
import App from './App.vue';
import './styles.css';

createApp(App).mount('#app');
```

### 與你問題相關的片段

**`html`／`body` 與橫向捲動：**

```61:68:/home/admin/frontend/src/styles.css
html, body {
  overflow-x: hidden;
  max-width: 100vw;
  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
}
html {
  overflow-y: scroll;
}
```

**手機底欄（fixed、`z-index: 10000`、safe area）：**

```418:444:/home/admin/frontend/src/styles.css
/* ===================== MOBILE BOTTOM NAV ===================== */
.mobile-bottom-nav {
  display: none; /* shown only at ≤640px */
}
...
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .mobile-bottom-nav {
    display: flex;
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: calc(56px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
    padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);
    background: #1e293b;
    z-index: 10000;
    box-shadow: 0 -2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
```

**「更多」抽層（overlay + fixed bottom sheet）：**

```499:527:/home/admin/frontend/src/styles.css
  /* More Bottom Sheet */
  .more-overlay {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    z-index: 10001;
  }
  .more-sheet {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: #1e293b;
    border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
    z-index: 10002;
    max-height: 70vh;
    max-height: 70dvh;
    overflow-y: auto;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    padding: 8px 16px 24px;
    transform: translate3d(0, 100%, 0);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    will-change: transform;
  }
  .more-sheet.open {
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
